/*======================================================================
 FILE: vcardparameter.c
 CREATOR: Ken Murchison 24 Aug 2022 <murch@fastmailteam.com>

 SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2022, Fastmail Pty. Ltd. (https://fastmail.com)
